%[text] - ∆Pmax in Function of Filter Order and Low Pass Filter Cutoff Frequency \
%[text] **5. Quantity of Interest (QoI) Extraction**
%[text] - ∆Pmax
%[text] - ∆P/∆t
%[text] - Impulse
%[text] - Summary Tables \
